close_reason: "Canonical --output-include projection modes now resolve to the command-local projection they alias on every declared read surface, verified byte-identical to the legacy flag across all 16 (surface, mode) pairs, and a projection that would strip every field from every row is refused with the legal domain instead of returning empty rows and exit 0. Both the CLI and MCP dispatch paths forward modes identically, and tests/unit/sdk/read-output-migration-hints.spec.ts executes every emitted hint rather than pinning its text."
